{"name": "XenoHaven", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"98\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/46686e5b46aa3e1cc3464ad91fc43931.avif?t=1790592283\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit familiars and put them to work around the base. Assign them to farming, mining, cooking, crafting, and more. Watch a barren patch of land grow into a thriving home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/3e6bf3ff5bb7930b2e97f96bf8bc7aea.poster.avif?t=1790592283\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/3e6bf3ff5bb7930b2e97f96bf8bc7aea.webm?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/3e6bf3ff5bb7930b2e97f96bf8bc7aea.mp4?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Familiars are more than just helping hands. Improve their attributes and shape each one for battle, then assemble a powerful squad ready to face the dangers beyond the base.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/abc59d0b14c4e44a899697c096ecae24.poster.avif?t=1790592283\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/abc59d0b14c4e44a899697c096ecae24.webm?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/abc59d0b14c4e44a899697c096ecae24.mp4?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"98\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/542d0cf14ebdb9f080e7586d94cfa2cf.avif?t=1790592283\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now featuring LAN co-op for up to 4 players and Steam Workshop support.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share the journey with friends. Farm together, run a shop, explore new regions, and see just how much this alien world has to offer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0c18521e0c01851726116e7b872d7b56.poster.avif?t=1790592283\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0c18521e0c01851726116e7b872d7b56.webm?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0c18521e0c01851726116e7b872d7b56.mp4?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape each area to suit the way you want to live. Create entirely new themes through Steam Workshop, but don\u2019t focus on comfort alone. A good home still needs to hold its ground.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/f36546d6cbbe37ee23239c9a217d9f98.poster.avif?t=1790592283\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/f36546d6cbbe37ee23239c9a217d9f98.webm?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/f36546d6cbbe37ee23239c9a217d9f98.mp4?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"98\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/f7de93e465ced690ce40cc0d3e577240.avif?t=1790592283\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farming and mining alone won\u2019t get you far. Explore dangerous dungeons and take on rival factions. Collect hundreds of weapons and pieces of gear to strengthen your squad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the Empire comes calling, will you submit or fight back? The fate of this world rests on your choice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/6e88a3f3ab0687b00d7f29c30cddd067.poster.avif?t=1790592283\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/6e88a3f3ab0687b00d7f29c30cddd067.webm?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/6e88a3f3ab0687b00d7f29c30cddd067.mp4?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"98\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/144f1f7822a570e10fd2a415a195e4b5.avif?t=1790592283\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Produce goods, stock the shop, and attract merchants from far and wide. Turn the base into a bustling haven where trade never stops.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/2d77f1124369dc7661f639f74947250f.poster.avif?t=1790592283\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/2d77f1124369dc7661f639f74947250f.webm?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/2d77f1124369dc7661f639f74947250f.mp4?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a popular restaurant and make it worth the trip. Develop signature dishes while offering food, entertainment, and lodging under one roof. Draw merchants from across the galaxy and earn a name in interstellar business.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/65dc4722f3760fed04acbde289179c16.poster.avif?t=1790592283\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/65dc4722f3760fed04acbde289179c16.webm?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/65dc4722f3760fed04acbde289179c16.mp4?t=1790592283\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "XenoHaven 1.0 is out now! Recruit familiars to farm, mine, craft, and fight by your side. Build a home with friends, battle bosses, run a restaurant, and make the planet your own with Steam Workshop creations.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/12740a079d8a3fafc5c2d098a9698d14bbfb0967/header.jpg?t=1790592283", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Open World", "Sandbox", "Survival", "Base Building", "Adventure", "Exploration"], "developers": "Miniverse Game", "publishers": "Miniverse Game", "release_date": "Sep 28, 2026", "price": "$7.99", "appid": "3461270", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "28 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/m-RtcROszUQ", "first_seen": 1790546400.0, "review_rank": 32}